>|name=heading-1|
Welcome to Markright

Markright is a rich text editor built with Rust and iced. This document showcases every paragraph type available in the editor.

>|name=heading-2|
Formatting

Rich text supports {{b} bold}, {{i} italic}, and {{u} underline} styles. You can also {{b i} combine them} freely within a single paragraph.

Spans can carry explicit attributes like {{sz=20} larger text}, {{c=2563eb} colored words}, or {{f=Georgia} a different font}. These are just a few of the options available.

>|name=heading-2|
Code

>|name=code-block|
fn main() {
>|name=code-block|
    let greeting = "Hello, Markright!";
>|name=code-block|
    println!("{greeting}");
>|name=code-block|
}

